usage: dolibarr_observe.py [-h] --url URL [--allow-remote-read]
                           --family {orders,products,thirdparties,invoices}
                           --id ID [--api-key-env API_KEY_ENV] [--out OUT]

Read-only production Dolibarr observer; no mutations

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --url URL             Origin only, e.g. https://erp.example.com
  --allow-remote-read   Explicitly opt into HTTPS remote reads
  --family {orders,products,thirdparties,invoices}
  --id ID
  --api-key-env API_KEY_ENV
  --out OUT             Private output; contains full record data, do not
                        share
